flowchart TD
  R[255 recipes: 17 classes x 5 materials x 3 patterns] --> W[Weapons]
  R --> A[Armour]
  R --> O[Other]
  W --> W1[Daggers / Swords / Axes / Maces]
  W --> W2[Polearms / Bows / Arcane foci]
  A --> A1[Mail: Vanguard / Breaker / Guardian]
  A --> A2[Leather: Duelist / Ranger]
  A --> A3[Cloth: Mage]
  O --> O1[Offhand: Shields / Books and relics]
  O --> O2[Ring: Rings]
  O --> O3[Charm: Charms / Talismans]
  O --> O4[Tool: Tools / Instruments]
  R --> M[Bronze / Iron / Steel / Mithril / Starforged]
  M --> T[Cheap training pattern]
  T --> S[Standard pattern]
  S --> N[Next material training pattern]
  S -. high attributes and mastery .-> P[Optional powerful prestige pattern]
  R -. independent modifiers .-> I[Quality / Crafted prefix / Enchanted suffix]
